title: Shower
tags:
---
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Hoping for a nice shower, you open the curtain, only to find a one-eyed corpse staring back at you..][/nomarkup]
{$pcName}: [nomarkup][...!][/nomarkup] #lastline #line:0a9835b
<<jump ShowerInteractions>>
===
title: ShowerInteractions
--- 
-> [nomarkup][Evaluate the cause of death.] (Intelligence + Medicine) [/nomarkup] <<if CustomVisited("CauseofDeath") == false>> #line:0ecd4b4 
    <<jump CauseofDeath>>
-> [nomarkup][Fleece the body.] (Wits + Streetwise) [/nomarkup] <<if CustomVisited("FleeceBody") == false>> #line:03acf5e 
    <<jump FleeceBody>>
-> [nomarkup][Walk away.][/nomarkup] #line:0684ec1 
    <<PlaySFX "door_knock_heavy">>
    <<CompleteObjective "Q_0P_MAIN_SATURDAY_START" "TAKE_SHOWER">>
    BANG! BANG! BANG!
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Not a good time for guests.][/nomarkup]
    -> [nomarkup][End dialogue.][/nomarkup]
===
title: CauseofDeath
tags:
---
<<if Roll("Intelligence","Medicine") >= 3>>
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][In addition to his missing eye, he has several bruises and gashes across his face and neck. Due to his complexion, he most likely died of blood loss.][/nomarkup] #lastline #success #line:0a668a1 
<<else>>
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You're not sure why he died, specifically, but the missing eye and hole in his neck certainly didn't help.][/nomarkup] #lastline #failure #line:0eb211a 
<<endif>>
<<jump ShowerInteractions>>
===
title: FleeceBody
tags:
---
<<if Roll("Wits","Streetwise") >= 3>>
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You find his wallet containing some money and ID. His name is Diego Vazguez.][/nomarkup] #success #line:0d4bee2 
    <<AddMoney 50>>
<<else>>
    {$storyteller}: [You find his wallet and ID, but his name is partially smeared in blood. You can only make out his initials - DV.][/nomarkup] #failure #line:0544c71 
<<endif>>
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You find a black and white photo of him holding a baby.][/nomarkup] #lastline #line:0b217be 
<<jump ShowerInteractions>>
===